OL,3,AFive killed and a dozen more injured in
OL,4,AKrakow shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolish police say five people have been
OL,7,Fkilled, and about a dozen more are
OL,8,Finjured, after a shooting in Krakow -
OL,9,Fwhat we know so far
OL,11,FTwo police officers are among the
OL,12,Finjured, with one in a "critical
OL,13,Fcondition", Interior Minister Marcin
OL,14,FKierwiEDski says
OL,16,FVideo shows gunshots ringing out in the
OL,17,Fsquare; images show emergency services
OL,18,Fat the scene
