OL,3,AFive killed and a dozen more injured in
OL,4,AKrakow shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say the suspect - who was shot
OL,7,Fby officers - has been taken to
OL,8,Fhospital. Meanwhile, an interior
OL,9,Fministry spokesperson says the suspect
OL,10,Fis a Polish citizen
OL,12,FIn a social media post, Polish PM
OL,13,FDonald Tusk calls the incident "tragic"
OL,14,Fand says he is being kept updated
